# 1️⃣2️⃣ VISITED ARRAY 🚨

Why do we need `visited`?

Consider:

```text
A ─ B
 \ /
  C
```

Without `visited`, traversal could repeatedly revisit nodes.

```text
A → B → C → A → B → C ...
```

Therefore:

```python
visited = set()
```

is fundamental in graph traversal.

