# 1️⃣5️⃣ CYCLE DETECTION 🔥

Cycle detection depends on whether the graph is:

### Undirected

Can use:

> DFS + Parent tracking

or:

> Union-Find

### Directed

Can use:

> DFS + recursion-state tracking

This distinction is **very important**.

