# 2️⃣5️⃣ MINIMUM SPANNING TREE 🌳

An MST connects:

> **All vertices with minimum total edge weight and no cycles.**

Two famous algorithms:

### Kruskal

```text
Sort edges
↓
Pick smallest edge
↓
Avoid cycle
↓
DSU
```

### Prim

```text
Start from a vertex
↓
Repeatedly choose minimum edge
↓
Min Heap
```

---

# 🧠 2️⃣6️⃣ KRUSKAL vs PRIM

| Kruskal                 | Prim                              |
| ----------------------- | --------------------------------- |
| Edge-based              | Vertex/tree-based                 |
| Sort edges              | Min Heap commonly used            |
| Uses DSU                | Uses priority queue               |
| Great for sparse graphs | Often convenient for dense graphs |

