# 💻 3️⃣0️⃣ MUST-KNOW CODE — BFS

```python
from collections import deque

def bfs(graph, start):
    q = deque([start])
    seen = {start}

    while q:
        node = q.popleft()

        for nei in graph[node]:
            if nei not in seen:
                seen.add(nei)
                q.append(nei)
```

### 🧠 Three things to remember:

```text
Queue
Visited
Neighbors
```

